{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46115","headline":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 四 · 贯休","name":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫髯青眼代天才，韩白孙吴稍可陪。\n祗见赤心尧日下，岂知真气梵天来。\n听经瑞雪时时落，登塔天花步步开。\n尽祝庄椿同寿考，人间岁月岂能催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}